decoding="async" data-nimg="fill" style="position:absolute;top:0;left:0;bottom:0;right:0;box-sizing:border-box;padding:0;border:none;margin:auto;display:block;width:0;height:0;min-width:100%;max-width:100%;min-height:100%;max-height:100%;object-fit:cover" loading="lazy"/></noscript></span></div></div></div></section><div class="flex flex-col gap-64px pb-[108px] rs-container"><div class="mt-8/vw md:mt-0"><h3 class="line-clamp-2 text-12/vw md:mb-16px mb-16/vw md:text-20px text-20/vw md:font-700 text-white/80 ">Plot of Poolboy</h3><div class="md:rounded-16px md:bg-[#141414] md:px-24px md:py-24px"><div class="relative min-w-0 w-full leading-[normal] text-12/vw md:text-14px rich-text break-words text-white/50 text-14/vw md:mt-0 md:text-14px md:leading-19px"><div data-collapsible-text-container="true" style="overflow:hidden" class="relative"><div data-collapsible-text-content="true"><div data-collapsible-text-content-body="true"><div>When high school swim team captain Aidan Crew loses his essential after-school job due to his rich bully Will Harrison standing up for him to his boss, he has no idea how he's going to pay his mother's substantial medical bills and rebuild his college fund, until Will offers Aidan a humiliating, but lucrative job as his pool boy. Aidan reluctantly takes the gig and the two start to fall for one another, but they must navigate the hatred between their families and vicious school bullies, while protecting the secret of Aidan's pool boy gig and the feelings building between them.</div></div></div></div><div data-collapsible-text-measure="true" aria-hidden="true" class="pointer-events-none invisible absolute left-0 top-0 w-full"><div>When high school swim team captain Aidan Crew loses his essential after-school job due to his rich bully Will Harrison standing up for him to his boss, he has no idea how he's going to pay his mother's substantial medical bills and rebuild his college fund, until Will offers Aidan a humiliating, but lucrative job as his pool boy. Aidan reluctantly takes the gig and the two start to fall for one another, but they must navigate the hatred between their families and vicious school bullies, while protecting the secret of Aidan's pool boy gig and the feelings building between them.</div></div><div data-collapsible-text-truncation-measure="true" aria-hidden="true" class="pointer-events-none invisible absolute left-0 top-0 w-full overflow-hidden"><span style="float:right;width:0"></span><div style="float:right;clear:both" class="flex items-center"><span class="lead cursor-pointer text-white/90 text-14/vw md:text-14px">More</span></div><div data-collapsible-text-truncation-candidate="true"></div></div><span aria-hidden="true" class="pointer-events-none invisible absolute block">M</span></div></div></div><div class=""><h3 class="mb-12/vw text-16/vw md:mb-12px md:text-20px text-white/90 md:text-white/80 font-700">You Might Like</h3><div class="grid grid-cols-3 gap-x-[1.333333vw] gap-y-[3.2vw] md:grid-cols-6 md:gap-x-24px md:gap-y-24px"></div></div></div></div><div class="rs-container"><div class="text-white px-16/vw md:px-0"><div class="md:hidden"><div class="relative -mx-16/vw overflow-hidden border-b border-white/10 md:hidden"><div class="absolute inset-x-0 top-0 h-288/vw overflow-hidden"><span style="box-sizing:border-box;display:block;overflow:hidden;width:initial;height:initial;background:none;opacity:1;border:0;margin:0;padding:0;position:absolute;top:0;left:0;bottom:0;right:0"><img alt="" sizes="100vw" srcSet="https://v-img.crazymaplestudios.com/v-images/book_cover_batch/200000200000000026/2322f565-8880-4b32-b976-b861f65377d8.jpg?x-oss-process=image%2Fresize%2Cw_640%2Fquality%2Cq_80 640w, https://v-img.crazymaplestudios.com/v-images/book_cover_batch/200000200000000026/2322f565-8880-4b32-b976-b861f65377d8.jpg?x-oss-process=image%2Fresize%2Cw_1080%2Fquality%2Cq_80 1080w, https://v-img.crazymaplestudios.com/v-images/book_cover_batch/200000200000000026/2322f565-8880-4b32-b976-b861f653