e/70 hover:text-white/90 !mb-8/vw !mr-4/vw !h-28/vw !rounded-20/vw !px-12/vw !leading-28/vw !text-12/vw text-white/70!" href="/tags/movie-tropes/competition-movies-676d210f4582b53a14081b68">Competition</a><a title="Glow-Up" class="text-12/vw md:text-16px line-clamp-1 break-all max-w-300/vw px-12/vw md:px-16px h-32/vw leading-32/vw rounded-full transition-colors duration-200 md:leading-36px md:text-[12px] md:h-36px  md:max-w-300px bg-white/10 hover:bg-white/20 text-white/70 hover:text-white/90 !mb-8/vw !mr-4/vw !h-28/vw !rounded-20/vw !px-12/vw !leading-28/vw !text-12/vw text-white/70!" href="/tags/movie-tropes/glow-up-movies-676d210f4582b53a14081b72">Glow-Up</a><div class="flex cursor-pointer items-center justify-center bg-white/10 hover:bg-white/20 rounded-full transition-colors duration-200 h-32/vw w-32/vw md:h-36px md:w-36px hidden"><span role="img" class="anticon text-30px"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="1em" height="1em" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 30 30" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" class=""><path fill="currentColor" d="M14.538 19.342a.628.628 0 0 1 0-.955l6.01-5.41a.81.81 0 0 1 1.06 0 .628.628 0 0 1 0 .955l-6.01 5.41a.81.81 0 0 1-1.06 0"></path><path fill="currentColor" d="M15.6 19.341a.81.81 0 0 1-1.06 0l-6.01-5.409a.628.628 0 0 1 0-.955.81.81 0 0 1 1.06 0l6.01 5.41a.628.628 0 0 1 0 .954"></path></svg></span></div></div></div><div class="mt-8/vw md:mt-0"><h3 class="line-clamp-2 text-12/vw md:mb-16px mb-16/vw md:text-20px text-20/vw md:font-700 text-white/80 hidden md:block">Plot of Poolboy</h3><div class="md:rounded-16px md:bg-[#141414] md:px-24px md:py-24px"><div class="relative min-w-0 w-full leading-[normal] text-12/vw md:text-14px rich-text break-words text-white/50 text-14/vw md:mt-0 md:text-14px md:leading-19px"><div data-collapsible-text-container="true" style="overflow:hidden" class="relative"><div data-collapsible-text-content="true"><div data-collapsible-text-content-body="true"><div>When high school swim team captain Aidan Crew loses his essential after-school job due to his rich bully Will Harrison standing up for him to his boss, he has no idea how he's going to pay his mother's substantial medical bills and rebuild his college fund, until Will offers Aidan a humiliating, but lucrative job as his pool boy. Aidan reluctantly takes the gig and the two start to fall for one another, but they must navigate the hatred between their families and vicious school bullies, while protecting the secret of Aidan's pool boy gig and the feelings building between them.</div></div></div></div><div data-collapsible-text-measure="true" aria-hidden="true" class="pointer-events-none invisible absolute left-0 top-0 w-full"><div>When high school swim team captain Aidan Crew loses his essential after-school job due to his rich bully Will Harrison standing up for him to his boss, he has no idea how he's going to pay his mother's substantial medical bills and rebuild his college fund, until Will offers Aidan a humiliating, but lucrative job as his pool boy. Aidan reluctantly takes the gig and the two start to fall for one another, but they must navigate the hatred between their families and vicious school bullies, while protecting the secret of Aidan's pool boy gig and the feelings building between them.</div></div><div data-collapsible-text-truncation-measure="true" aria-hidden="true" class="pointer-events-none invisible absolute left-0 top-0 w-full overflow-hidden"><span style="float:right;width:0"></span><div style="float:right;clear:both" class="flex items-center"><span class="lead cursor-pointer text-white/90 text-14/vw md:text-14px">More</span></div><div data-collapsible-text-truncation-candidate="true"></div></div><span aria-hidden="true" class="pointer-events-none invisible absolute block">M</span></div></div></div><div class="h-1/vw bg-white/10 my-24/vw"></div><div class="flex flex-col gap-40/vw pb-80/vw"><div class=""><h3 class="mb-12/vw text-16/vw md:mb-12px md:text-20px text-white/90 md:text-white/80 font-700">You Might Like</h3><div class="grid grid-cols-3 gap-x-[1.333333vw] gap-y-[3.2vw] md:grid-cols-6 md:gap-x-24px md:gap-y-24px"></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="w-full overflow-hidden md:hidden"><footer class="Footer_footer__wSzLt" style="margin-top:0"><div><div class="Footer_collapse_box__3OKgp"><div class="Footer_title__VvzfP Footer_collapse_item__oHPSq"><span>ABOUT</span><span class="Footer_chevron__uCZje"></span></div><div class="Footer_content__TNOnn"><a class="Footer_collapse_item__oHPSq" href="/web-terms.html" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer"><div>Terms of Service</div></a><a class="Footer_collapse_item__oHPSq" href="/web-privacy.html" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer"><div>Privacy Policy</div></a><a class="Footer_collapse_item__oHPSq" href="mailto:reelshort.support@crazymaplestudio.com" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer"><div>Contact Us<div class="Footer_tips__Zpvsk">Service Hours: Monday to Sunday, 12am to 8am(ET)</div></div></a></div></div><div class="Footer_collapse_box__3OKgp"><div class="Footer_title__VvzfP Footer_collapse_item__oHPSq"><span>SUPPORT</span><span class="Footer_chevron__uCZje"></span></div><div class="Footer_content__TNOnn"><div class="Footer_collapse_item__oHPSq">Feedback</div><a class="Footer_collapse_item__oHPSq" href="mailto:rachelbencosme@crazymaplestudio.com" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer"><div>Media &amp; Public Relations</div></a></div></div></div><div class="Footer_brand_area__mLcg8"><div class="Footer_logo_group__iMwbs"><img class="Footer_logo__soZ9_" src="https://v-mps.crazymaplestudios.com/images/8f9e3f90-5a37-11f1-b0e9-f1e04973cf14.png" width="120" height="18" alt="ReelShort"/><div class="Footer_copyright__9IgNw rtl">© 2026 Crazy Maple Studio™, Inc. All Rights Reserved.</div></div><div class="Footer_community_list__bqCHV"><a href="https://www.facebook.com/ReelShortTV/" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="40" height="40" fill="none"><path stroke="#